WEBVTT

00:00:00.133 --> 00:00:00.667
Okay!

00:00:00.667 --> 00:00:03.267
Which one does NOT belong?

00:00:08.633 --> 00:00:09.700
TIME'S UP!

00:00:10.133 --> 00:00:11.600
The answer is...

00:00:11.600 --> 00:00:12.067
A,

00:00:12.067 --> 00:00:12.567
glass!

00:00:12.567 --> 00:00:13.533
A hammer,

00:00:13.533 --> 00:00:14.000
saw,

00:00:14.000 --> 00:00:15.933
and wrench are tools.

00:00:15.933 --> 00:00:17.867
Glass is a material,

00:00:17.867 --> 00:00:20.300
so it does not belong.

00:00:20.800 --> 00:00:21.633
Here's one,

00:00:21.633 --> 00:00:22.900
a shape puzzle!

00:00:22.900 --> 00:00:24.567
Which shape comes next?

00:00:29.933 --> 00:00:31.000
TIME'S UP!

00:00:31.433 --> 00:00:32.600
The answer is...

00:00:32.600 --> 00:00:32.967
D,

00:00:32.967 --> 00:00:33.733
a triangle!

00:00:33.733 --> 00:00:36.067
The number of sides goes down

00:00:36.067 --> 00:00:37.600
by one each step,

00:00:37.600 --> 00:00:40.300
so the next shape is the triangle.

00:00:40.833 --> 00:00:42.133
Here's one,

00:00:42.133 --> 00:00:44.067
a number series!

00:00:44.067 --> 00:00:44.700
Four,

00:00:44.700 --> 00:00:45.367
three,

00:00:45.367 --> 00:00:46.000
seven,

00:00:46.000 --> 00:00:46.633
ten,

00:00:46.633 --> 00:00:47.300
seventeen,

00:00:47.300 --> 00:00:48.567
and then...

00:00:48.567 --> 00:00:50.500
what comes next?

00:00:55.900 --> 00:00:56.967
TIME'S UP!

00:00:57.400 --> 00:00:58.867
The answer is...

00:00:58.867 --> 00:00:59.367
B,

00:00:59.367 --> 00:00:59.867
twenty-seven!

00:00:59.867 --> 00:01:02.800
Add the two numbers before it:

00:01:02.800 --> 00:01:05.233
seventeen plus ten is twenty-seven.

00:01:05.767 --> 00:01:06.133
So,

00:01:06.133 --> 00:01:07.933
are you smart or fart?

00:01:07.933 --> 00:01:10.133
Count up your correct answers to

00:01:10.133 --> 00:01:11.200
find your rank!

00:01:11.733 --> 00:01:12.033
So,

00:01:12.033 --> 00:01:13.267
how did you do?

00:01:13.267 --> 00:01:14.500
Comment your score below,

00:01:14.500 --> 00:01:15.733
and follow for more!
